            "review_title": "Review at Mon's Pizza",
            "review_text": "ShaunandAl\nMorisset, Australia46 contributions\n1\nModern and attractive, great Western food\nOct 2019\nThis is a new restaurant in Ha Noi, serving pizza and fabulous Western food at Vietnam prices. The owner and manager Thu Tong (Alex) has a range of experience in restaurant management and has turned this knowledge into a great new concept. The decor is modern and attractive and there is an upstairs room for parties etc. The menu choices will appeal to any taste and our salmon was beautifully cooked and presented. For a truly enjoyable Western meal served with traditional Vietnamese hospitality, we highly recommend Mon’s Pizza to all local residents and visitors.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 18, 2020",
